{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54626","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬三月，何事忽雷鸣？只利客居（川本作「军」）非利主（辛本、川本作「土」），高旗先举定须赢，後战必无成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}